<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; background-color: white">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; background-color: white">On December 31, 2024, the Company held its 2024
Annual Meeting of Stockholders.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; background-color: white">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; background-color: white">The matters voted upon at the Annual Meeting and
the results of such voting are set forth below.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; background-color: white"><b>&#160;</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; background-color: white"><b>&#160;</b></p>

